{
  "listName": "The Wolf of Wall Street",
  "category": "B1",
  "order": 8,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "title": "First Day on Wall Street",
      "level": "B1",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Mark", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan Belfort is twenty-two years old and brand new to Wall Street. He gets a job at a firm in Manhattan, where a senior broker named Mark Hanna takes him under his wing. Mark has strong opinions about success, money, and what this business really is.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I want to make a lot of money.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Good. That's the right answer.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "How do you do it?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Move money. Keep the client moving.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "What does the client get?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Doesn't matter. You get the commission.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "That sounds wrong.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "It sounds like Wall Street.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan is shocked but fascinated. Mark orders two martinis at lunch, talks fast, laughs loud, and seems completely at home in a world Jordan barely understands. This is the first lesson: confidence sells.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Do you like money, Jordan?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Yes. Very much.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Then you'll love this job.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "How long until I make real money?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Depends how fast you learn.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I learn fast.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Mark",
          "text": "Then you'll be rich in no time.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The firm crashes on Black Monday. Jordan loses his job on his very first day as a licensed broker. He ends up in a strip-mall boiler room on Long Island, selling penny stocks to working-class people. But he is very, very good at it.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Hi, I'm calling about an opportunity.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "This stock is about to move.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Can you afford to miss it?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'll only need five minutes.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Trust me. This one is different.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "His first sale earns him a fifty-percent commission. He looks at the check in his hand and feels something he has never felt before. He wants more of it. Much more.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm going to be rich.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I can feel it. I just know.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "title": "Stratton Oakmont",
      "level": "B1",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Donnie", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan meets Donnie Azoff at a diner. Donnie sells furniture but wants out. He hears Jordan talking about money and immediately quits his job. Together, they start their own firm. Jordan names it Stratton Oakmont — it sounds old, it sounds trustworthy, it sounds like money.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "How much did you make last month?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Seventy-two thousand dollars.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "In one month?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "In one month.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "I want in. Right now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You'd quit your job today?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "I already quit. What's next?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan recruits his old neighborhood friends — guys with no experience, no licenses, and no fear. He trains them himself, drilling the script into their heads until they can sell anything to anyone. The office looks like a circus, but the money is absolutely real.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Repeat after me. Every word.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Okay. I'm ready.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Hi, my name is Jordan Belfort.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm calling from Stratton Oakmont.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I have a stock that will double.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "What if they say no?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Nobody says no to this pitch.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Are you serious right now?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Dead serious. Pick up the phone.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The firm grows fast. They move out of the small office and into a real building. Jordan gives motivational speeches every morning. The brokers go wild. Sales numbers go through the roof. Donnie becomes Jordan's closest partner and his most loyal follower.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Are you guys ready to get rich?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Yes! Let's go! Right now!",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Then pick up the phone!",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "This is the best job ever.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "It's not a job. It's a lifestyle.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
      "title": "The Good Life",
      "level": "B1",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Naomi", "voice": "female-1" },
        { "name": "Donnie", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan is now one of the richest people on Wall Street. He lives in a mansion, drives expensive cars, throws wild parties, and spends money faster than he makes it. He also meets Naomi Lapaglia — a beautiful woman who becomes his girlfriend and then his second wife.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "Is all of this really yours?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Every single bit of it.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "You're not normal, are you.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Normal people are not this happy.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "You think money buys happiness?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I think poverty buys nothing.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan buys a yacht named after Naomi. He orders a helicopter for the commute. He buys a second house just for parties. The excess is almost impossible to describe — it is a world where money has no meaning because there is always more of it.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "You bought a helicopter?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Traffic is terrible. It makes sense.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "A helicopter makes sense to you.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Don't you have a helicopter?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "I will by tomorrow.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "That's the spirit.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "Jordan, you need to slow down.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Slow down? We're just starting.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "You're taking too many risks.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Risks? This is all calculated.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "But not everything is under control. Jordan starts using drugs heavily — quaaludes, cocaine, anything available. He tells himself he can stop whenever he wants. He cannot.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "I'm worried about you.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm fine. Better than fine.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "You don't look fine to me.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Trust me. Everything is great.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "title": "The FBI Knocks",
      "level": "B2",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Agent Denham", "voice": "male-3" },
        { "name": "Donnie", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "FBI agent Patrick Denham has been watching Stratton Oakmont for years. He boards Jordan's yacht one morning — not with a warrant, but just to introduce himself, to make his presence known, to let Jordan feel the pressure starting to build.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "Nice boat you've got here.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "It's a yacht, actually.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "Right. A yacht. My mistake.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Can I help you with something?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "Just wanted to say hello.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You could have called.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "I prefer to meet people in person.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "What exactly do you want?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "Nothing today. Just watching.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan keeps his composure but feels the ground shift beneath him. He has always known this moment would come — a man in a government suit showing up and smiling too politely. He just believed he would be untouchable by then.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Who was that guy?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "FBI. He knows everything.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Should we be worried right now?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Not yet. But soon.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "What do we do about the money?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "We move it. Tonight.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Move it where exactly?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Switzerland. I know a banker.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan uses Naomi's aunt to open Swiss bank accounts under a fake name. He smuggles cash in suitcases, wires money through shell companies, and builds a wall of deception between himself and the federal government. It is elaborate. It is illegal. And it works — for a while.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "We're going to find everything.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You're welcome to try.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "I'm a patient man, Mr. Belfort.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "So am I. Believe me.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "title": "The Quaalude Crawl",
      "level": "B2",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Donnie", "voice": "male-2" },
        { "name": "Naomi", "voice": "female-1" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan's drug use is completely out of control. One night he takes a batch of quaaludes that hit later than expected — while he is driving. What follows is a blackout journey home that he cannot remember, a destroyed car in the driveway, and a phone call he should never have made.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Jordan, you drove home like that?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I made it, didn't I?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Your car is completely destroyed.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'll buy another one today.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "You could have killed somebody.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "But I didn't. So it's fine.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Naomi has finally had enough. She files for divorce and threatens to take their daughter. Jordan, high and desperate, tries to leave on the yacht during a storm to stop her. The yacht nearly sinks in the Mediterranean Sea.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "I'm done. I want a divorce.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You're not taking my daughter.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "Then get sober. Right now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I can stop whenever I want.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "Prove it. Stop right now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "It's not that simple.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "That's exactly what I thought.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Jordan, the storm is getting bad.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Keep going. Full speed ahead.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "We're going to sink, man.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "This boat doesn't sink. Trust me.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "A rescue helicopter finds them. They survive, but everything feels different afterward. Jordan is starting to understand — slowly, reluctantly — that he is not in control of anything.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "We almost died out there.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Yeah. We actually almost died.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Maybe I need to slow down.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "That's the first smart thing.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 6,
      "title": "The Deal with the FBI",
      "level": "B2",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Agent Denham", "voice": "male-3" },
        { "name": "Donnie", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The FBI's case is airtight. Jordan's Swiss banker has been arrested. His money laundering operation is fully exposed. His lawyer tells him the government is offering a deal — cooperate, wear a wire on his friends, and walk away with a reduced sentence.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "We have everything we need.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "So why are you offering a deal?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "We want the bigger fish.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You want me to betray my friends.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "I want you to save yourself.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "What's in it for me exactly?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "Freedom. A real life after this.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jordan agonizes over the decision. He has always believed in loyalty — it is the one value he held onto even as everything else fell away. But he is looking at decades in prison, and he has a daughter.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I don't know if I can do this.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "Do what? What's happening?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "The FBI wants me to cooperate.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "You're not going to, right?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I have a daughter, Donnie.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "We're brothers. You can't do this.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I haven't decided anything yet.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "At the office, Jordan gives one last extraordinary speech. He tells his brokers he is staying — that he will fight this and win. The room goes insane with cheering. Then he walks back to his desk, picks up the phone, and calls the FBI.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I told them I was staying.",
