          "text": "And then you called them anyway.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I had to protect my family.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Donnie",
          "text": "You could have protected us too.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm sorry. I really am.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
