          "text": "Smart choice. Took you long enough.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm not proud of any of this.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Naomi goes through with the divorce. Jordan loses the mansion, the yacht, and the helicopter. He is sentenced to thirty-six months in a minimum-security prison — a sentence his cooperation helped reduce significantly. His brokers receive longer sentences.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "I can't stay with you, Jordan.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I understand. I ruined everything.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "Our daughter still needs her father.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I know. I'll be there for her.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Naomi",
          "text": "You need to actually mean that.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I mean it. Things are different now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Agent Denham",
          "text": "You're going to prison for this.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
