    {
      "chapter": 8,
      "title": "The Salesman Always Sells",
      "level": "C1",
      "characters": [
        { "name": "Narrator", "voice": "Elearning" },
        { "name": "Jordan", "voice": "male-1" },
        { "name": "Audience", "voice": "male-2" }
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "After prison, Jordan reinvents himself as a motivational speaker and sales trainer. He tours the world teaching the same techniques he used at Stratton Oakmont — now marketed as legitimate business skills. Audiences pay hundreds of dollars to sit in conference rooms and hear him talk about selling.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Sell me this pen.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "It's a really nice pen.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "That's not how you sell it.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "Then how do you sell it?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Create the need. Create the feeling.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "What feeling does a pen create?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "The feeling that you need to write.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "He is magnetic on stage. Crowds lean forward, take notes, laugh at his stories. He admits to everything — the drugs, the fraud, the sinking yacht — and frames it all as a cautionary tale with practical lessons attached. Whether this constitutes redemption is a question the film leaves open.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I made every mistake you can imagine.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "And you're proud of that?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "I'm not proud. I'm honest.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "Is there a difference anymore?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "That's a very good question.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Yes. There is a difference.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The last scene of the film shows Jordan walking onto a stage in New Zealand. He looks at a crowd of eager faces — people who want to learn, who want to succeed, who believe in the power of the right sales pitch. He looks back at them and sees himself, twenty years ago, sitting in the strip-mall office, ready to pick up the phone.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Who are you? Tell me right now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "I'm a closer. I sell anything.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Then sell me that pen. Now.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "Can I have your autograph first?",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "You'd need a pen for that.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Audience",
          "text": "Exactly. Buy this pen.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Jordan",
          "text": "Now that's how you sell.",
          "repeat": true,
          "pauseAfter": 3
        },
        {
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The hunger in the room is identical to the hunger Jordan once carried. Whether that is inspiring or deeply unsettling depends entirely on where you are sitting.",
          "repeat": false,
          "pauseAfter": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
